      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING GISELLE (2) has switched yards since finishing eighth a month ago over 1450m at Muswellbrook. Will find this easier than recent NSW efforts and shapes as a key runner. LILII BOREA (6) made progress last time out, finishing 6 lengths from the winner in second at the end of 1200m at this track after being in contention on the bend. Suitably placed so anticipating another big run. MACHO GRANDE (1) finished out of the money two starts back then he was always well out of his ground and was beaten 15 lengths when tenth over 1900m at Canberra Acton four weeks ago. Ideally placed against this line-up and is sure to play a pivotal role. PERRIERES (8) was prominent until they straightened last time but weakened to finish fourth, beaten 9 lengths, over 1400m at Beaudesert. Gets 2kg off with the claim and is likely to be thereabouts.",
